Sat Nov 21 21:23:20 UTC 2026 - Dirk Müller <dmueller@suse.com>

- update to 43.0.0:
  * [cpp] BREAKING CHANGE: Updated coding style, breaks includes,
    class and member names.
  * [cpp] Added benchmark target.
  * [cpp] Added optional RE2 support as a regex engine backend.
  * [Python] Dropped support for Python 3.10
  * [Ruby] Move the version constant to `lib/gherkin/version.rb`.
  * [Elixir] Bump minimum elixir version to 1.13
  * Update dependency `messages` up to v35
  * (i18n) Remove trailing space from Texan Rule keyword.
  * [Ruby] Substitute example values into scenario outlines
    literally, as the other implementations do, instead of
    reading them as replacement patterns.

